<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-053" chapter-id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai" source-id="s-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai-ws1518868">
  <p id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">豫章王<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001:m0003" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p001:m0005" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">世謙</persName>，武帝第二子也。天監三年，封豫章郡王。累遷北中郎將、南徐州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p002:m0002" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>母<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p002:m0004" ref="tpj_t61_f20">吳</persName>淑媛在齊東昏宮</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及得幸于武帝，七月而生<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p003:m0011" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>，宮中多疑之。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p004:m0000" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">綜</persName>改名<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p004:m0003" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">贊</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-053-xiaozong-wangtai:p004:m0005" ref="syn_jn4_wiu">德文</persName>，追服齊東昏斬衰</p>
</text>
